<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Jaya Tiasa six-mth net up 8 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Jaya Tiasa six-mth net up 8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Oct 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   75.92	   vs	 70.20</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  29.92	   vs	 27.67</p>
<p>    Turnover		    202.25	   vs	203.16</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     79.72	   vs	 73.72</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)	  3.0	    vs	  3.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Jaya Tiasa Holdings Bhd. It is involved in selling veneer, plywood, blockboard and sawn timber.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
